<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλᾰν</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰνος</span>, τό, (neut. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλας</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ink</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				276c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ. τρίβων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.258
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				5.66
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γραφικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.69
				</span></i>
			; used of a drawing material capable of erasure, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				3.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. Ἰνδικόν</span>”
				<i>indigo,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Peripl.M.Rubr.
					39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>iris</i> of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				491b21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>cornea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.772
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰδοῖον, τὸ μ. τῷ μ.
					συναρμόσαι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.403
			</span></i>.</div>
